msgid "<b>Error:</b> Failed to execute WordNet program 'wn'. WordNet has to be installed on your computer if you want to use it, and 'wn' has to be in your PATH. You can get WordNet at <a href=\"http://wordnet.princeton.edu/\">http://wordnet.princeton.edu/</a>. Note that WordNet only supports the English language."
